sage","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これ、多分閉じようとした時点でpopup破棄されちゃってるからエラー吐いて戻ろうとした時に無を参照しちゃって死ぬんだろうな","ts":"1622366029.043600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cpO8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf8048ec-00f1-4ab2-9f8b-d651ef4fb933","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":yoshi:  \u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8286\u003e","ts":"1622365996.042800","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Crash when popup terminal closing by hand on cmdwin · Issue #8286 · vim/vim","id":1,"title":"Crash when popup terminal closing by hand on cmdwin · Issue #8286 · vim/vim","title_link":"https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8286","text":"Describe the bug Cause crash after E813 when popup terminal closing by hand on cmdwin. To Reproduce Detailed steps to reproduce the behavior: Write below code to any file. :w foo.vim let buf = term...","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/d24d5d20b6829adea3af1ea82b5582c2c4aa0d43a477214fa3ae94be2ad081fb/vim/vim/issues/8286","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8286","original_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8286"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RTn7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f4441d0-540b-4bfe-a18a-8ca0b9ccb562","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"```let buf = term_start(['/bin/echo'], #{hidden: 1})\nlet winid = popup_create(buf, #{minwidth: 50, minheight: 20})```\n`:h popup-terminal`に書いてあるやつを適当にいじったものを保存して\ncmdwinの中でsourcingする\nすると真ん中に死んだターミナルの跡が出てくるので閉じようとすると死ぬ","ts":"1622362159.042500","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1622362516.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/kj/A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"731eaee9-88d5-4c08-b800-252fe03ecfd6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003c